import VersoManual
import Netring.Meta.Lean

-- This gets access to most of the manual genre (which is also useful for textbooks)
open Verso.Genre Manual

-- This gets access to Lean code that's in code blocks, elaborated in the same process and
-- environment as Verso
open Verso.Genre.Manual.InlineLean


open Netring

set_option pp.rawOnError true

#doc (Manual) "Cat Haikus" =>

# NTU Cats

## In the Hat

![Cat in a hat](assets/cathaikus/catinthehat.png)

## Dance

_hare's hearing, lion's sight —_

_red leaves flutter on bird's tail —_

_how the autumn dances_

![Dancing cat](assets/cathaikus/dance.jpg)

## Echo

_Weirdly empty space_

_As my meowing gets louder_

_so does the echo_

![Echo](assets/cathaikus/echo.png)

## Kat

Totally rad.

![Kat cat](assets/cathaikus/mimi_kat.png)

## Palm

_What are the palm trees_

_peeking round the corner at?_

_I wanna see too_

![Palm cat](assets/cathaikus/palm.png)

## Path

_The path ahead_

_Blurred by my breath on the glass_

_Suddenly, my face_

![Path cat](assets/cathaikus/path.png)

## Snail

_Resting at one end_

_of a long and arduous bridge_

_is a little snail._

![Snail cat](assets/cathaikus/snail.jpg)

## Tree

_Staring back at me_

_That black cat beneath the tree_

_Boy. he looks so free..._

![Tree cat](assets/cathaikus/tree.png)

