# SUTD Cats

## Amber

_After the wildfire_

_'neath new grass, in a burnt stump_

_amber beads remain_

![Burnt cat](assets/cathaikus/amber.png)

## Curtain

_Could a blue curtain_

_give relief to those who lack_

_of a clear blue sky?_

![Pondering cat](assets/cathaikus/curtain.png)

## Dreams

_The schoolbell's ringing_

_spurs the crowd to wayward flight_

_and a kitty dreams._

![Dreaming cat](assets/cathaikus/jerry_dreams.png)

## Guard

_On this terraced hill_

_stands a tower with a guard_

_who is really cute._

![Guard cat](assets/cathaikus/jerry_guard.png)

## Journey

_The world is too big..._

_At least it means I can go_

_anywhere I want!_

![Tunnel snail](assets/cathaikus/journey.png)

## Leaf

It's hard to avoid the green stuff when you're living the rockstar life.

![Leaf cat](assets/cathaikus/jerry_leaf.png)

## Sakura

_Chilly from the rain_

_as sakura blossoms fall_

_a tiger watches_

![Sakura cat](assets/cathaikus/sakura.png)

## Sesame

_The sesame bun_

_squishy-soft as it might look_

_is not for eating_

![Sesame cat](assets/cathaikus/sesame.png)

## Stretch

_I will yawn and stretch_

_til my head and feet do reach_

_both ends of this bench_

![Bench cat](assets/cathaikus/stretch.png)

## Sun

_The sun has risen_

_but strangely, it no longer_

_glares and blinds my eyes._

_Now, when I look around me_

_I just see smiling faces._

![Jerry](assets/cathaikus/jerry_sun.png)

## Turf

_You see this turf here?_

_Best racket I ever had._

_('Cos of all the treats.)_

![Turf cat](assets/cathaikus/yakuza_turf.png)

